{
  "cited_article_id": "troubleshoot-lab-interface",
  "reply": "Please have a System Administrator open the Admin console, go to **Admin > Interfaces > Lab Connectivity**, locate the vendor, run the **Diagnostics** ping, and if it shows offline click **Action > Restart Service**. Wait about three minutes for the queue to clear. If the status stays red, check that your firewall allows outbound traffic on port 443 to the gateway IP, then capture any error code from the event log for a support ticket."
}
